AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:SWO_0000133 "DAVID (the Database for Annotation, Visualization and Integrated Discovery) is a free online bioinformatics resource developed by the Laboratory of Immunopathogenesis and Bioinformatics (LIB). All tools in the DAVID Bioinformatics Resources aim to provide functional interpretation of large lists of genes derived from genomic studies, e.g. microarray and proteomics studies."@en)
