# Class: obo:SWO_0000135 (PSI-BLAST)

AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:SWO_0000135 "Position-Specific Iterated (PSI)-BLAST is the most sensitive BLAST program, making it useful for finding very distantly related proteins or new members of a protein family. Use PSI-BLAST when your standard protein-protein BLAST search either failed to find significant hits, or returned hits with descriptions such as \"hypothetical protein\" or \"similar to...\"."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000119 obo:SWO_0000135 "NIH BLAST homepage")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:SWO_0000135 "PSI-BLAST"@en)
