# Class: obo:SWO_0000154 (COBRA)

AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:SWO_0000154 "COBRA (COnstraint-Based Reconstruction and Analysis Toolbox) includes implementations of many of the commonly used forms of constraint-based analysis such as FBA, gene deletions, flux variability analysis, sampling, and batch simulations together with tools to read in and manipulate constraint-based models."@en)
