# Class: obo:SWO_0000506 (cosmo)

AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:SWO_0000506 "cosmo searches a set of unaligned DNA sequences for a shared motif that may, for example, represent a common transcription factor binding site. The algorithm is similar to MEME, but also allows the user to specify a set of constraints that the position weight matrix of the unknown motif must satisfy. Such constraints may include bounds on the information content across certain regions of the unknown motif, for example, and can often be formulated on the basis of prior knowledge about the structure of the transcription factor in question. The unknown motif width, the distribution of motif occurrences (OOPS, ZOOPS, or TCM), as well as the appropriate constraint set can be selected data-adaptively."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000119 obo:SWO_0000506 "http://bioconductor.org/packages/2.4/bioc/html/cosmo.html")
AnnotationAssertion(terms:creator obo:SWO_0000506 "Nandini Badarinarayan")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:SWO_0000506 "cosmo"@en)
SubClassOf(obo:SWO_0000506 obo:SWO_0000001)
SubClassOf(obo:SWO_0000506 ObjectSomeValuesFrom(obo:SWO_0000740 obo:SWO_1100077))
SubClassOf(obo:SWO_0000506 ObjectSomeValuesFrom(obo:SWO_0000741 obo:SWO_0000415))
SubClassOf(obo:SWO_0000506 ObjectSomeValuesFrom(obo:SWO_0040005 obo:SWO_0000553))

# Class: obo:SWO_0000507 (cosmoGUI)

AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:SWO_0000507 "cosmoGUI allows the user to interactively define constraint sets that can be used by the cosmo package to supervise the search for shared motifs in a set of DNA sequences. The constraints can be either adapted from a set of commonly used templates or defined from scratch."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000119 obo:SWO_0000507 "http://bioconductor.org/packages/2.4/bioc/html/cosmoGUI.html")
AnnotationAssertion(terms:creator obo:SWO_0000507 "Nandini Badarinarayan")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:SWO_0000507 "cosmoGUI"@en)
