# Class: obo:SWO_1100006 (AIDA)

AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000119 obo:SWO_1100006 "AIDA is a modular software package for evaluation and documentation of images that were obtained with digital devices such as CCD cameras, flat bed scanners, or BAS / FLA- scanners from Fuji. Additionally, AIDA allows the loading of loading a variety of images in other image formats (e.g.: TIFF, JPEG, Bmp, gel). AIDA can control all scanning devices offering a TWAIN compatible driver.")
