# Class: obo:SWO_1100064 (ChipReader 3.1)

AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:SWO_1100064 "Versarray ChipReader systems are highly sensitive laser confocal systems designed for rapid imaging of microarrays. These are advanced scanners that meet your expectations, differentiating between a spot response and background level, and optimizing the signal on the bottom as well as the top end of the range for increased sensitivity. Results with versarray chipreader systems have a low background, enhanced weak signal detection, and virtually no photobleaching for a long dye lifetime."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000119 obo:SWO_1100064 "http://www.bio-medicine.org/")
AnnotationAssertion(terms:creator obo:SWO_1100064 "Nandini Badarinarayan")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:SWO_1100064 "ChipReader 3.1"@en)
SubClassOf(obo:SWO_1100064 obo:SWO_0000001)

