# Class: obo:SWO_1100130 (Seurat)

AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:SWO_1100130 "Seurat is an R package designed for QC, analysis, and exploration of single-cell RNA-seq data. Seurat aims to enable users to identify and interpret sources of heterogeneity from single-cell transcriptomic measurements, and to integrate diverse types of single-cell data."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(terms:creator obo:SWO_1100130 "Allyson Lister")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment obo:SWO_1100130 "AL 8.10.2019: Added in reference to https://github.com/allysonlister/swo/issues/13"@en)
