# Class: obo:SWO_1100136 (AnalyzerPro)

AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:SWO_1100136 "AnalyzerPro​ is a productivity software application for both low and high resolution LC-MS and GC-MS data with support for multiple vendors’ data. This comprehensive post-processing utility provides optimized workflows for sample-to-sample comparison, target component analysis, quantitation and library searching for data generated from any LC-MS and GC-MS platform"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(terms:creator obo:SWO_1100136 "Allyson Lister")
AnnotationAssertion(terms:creator obo:SWO_1100136 "Mark Reuter")
