# Class: obo:SWO_1100144 (FastQC)

AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:SWO_1100144 "FastQC aims to provide a simple way to do some quality control checks on raw sequence data coming from high throughput sequencing pipelines. It provides a modular set of analyses which you can use to give a quick impression of whether your data has any problems of which you should be aware before doing any further analysis."@en)
